      "content": "<p>But-2-yne is reacted separately with one mole of Hydrogen as shown below :</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1ldoui605/c6828379-a4a2-4fb3-b4d2-60340e15e015/888bf150-a3ee-11ed-b56d-63317aef4a22/file-1ldoui606.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1ldoui605/c6828379-a4a2-4fb3-b4d2-60340e15e015/888bf150-a3ee-11ed-b56d-63317aef4a22/file-1ldoui606.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 1st February Morning Shift Chemistry - Hydrocarbons Question 78 English\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1ldoui605/c6828379-a4a2-4fb3-b4d2-60340e15e015/888bf150-a3ee-11ed-b56d-63317aef4a22/file-1ldoui606.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1ldoui605/c6828379-a4a2-4fb3-b4d2-60340e15e015/888bf150-a3ee-11ed-b56d-63317aef4a22/file-1ldoui606.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1ldoui605/c6828379-a4a2-4fb3-b4d2-60340e15e015/888bf150-a3ee-11ed-b56d-63317aef4a22/file-1ldoui606.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1ldoui605/c6828379-a4a2-4fb3-b4d2-60340e15e015/888bf150-a3ee-11ed-b56d-63317aef4a22/file-1ldoui606.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1ldoui605/c6828379-a4a2-4fb3-b4d2-60340e15e015/888bf150-a3ee-11ed-b56d-63317aef4a22/file-1ldoui606.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1ldoui605/c6828379-a4a2-4fb3-b4d2-60340e15e015/888bf150-a3ee-11ed-b56d-63317aef4a22/file-1ldoui606.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>A. A is more soluble than B.</p>\n<p>B. The boiling point &amp; melting point of A are higher and lower than B respectively.</p>\n<p>C. A is more polar than B because dipole moment of A is zero.</p>\n<p>D. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.476ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1536.6 833\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1133,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> adds easily to B than A.</p>\n<p>Identify the <b>incorrect</b> statements from the options given below :</p>",
